---

### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
dist-ssr/

# Logs and local caches
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.vite/

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Editor and OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
